{title: Konta Zenda Gheu Haati}
{artist: Avdhoot Gupte}
{key: G#}

{c: Verse 1}
[G#] [F#m] [A],        jagnyachya vaarit milena vaat hoooo
[G#] [F#m] [A],        sachale mohache dhuke ghandhat hooo
[G#] [C#m],        aapli manas aaplich maati
[G#] [C#m],        tari kalpachi mendhkas bhiti
[A] [B] [A] [G#],        vithhalaaaaa konta zenda gheu haathi
[G#] [C#m] [D#],        aajwar jyachi waahili palkhi
[D#] [C#m] [G#],        bhaltach tyancha dev hotaaaaa*2
[G#] [C#m] [D#],        pure zale aata uga maate khodi
[D#] [C#m] [G#],        dagdat maaza jeev hotaaaa*2
[G#] [C#m] [D#],        ujlawa diva mhanuniya kiti
[D#] [C#m],        mukya bicharya jalti waati
[G#] [C#m],        vairi kon aahe ithe kon sathi
[A] [B] [A] [G#],        vithhalaaaaa konta zenda gheu haathi
